  "termsConditionsScreenTitle": "Terms & Conditions",
  "termsConditionsLastUpdated": "Last updated: August 2026",

  "termsConditionsSection1Title": "1. Platform Overview & Acceptance",
  "termsConditionsSection1Point1": "Bosdom is a localized B2B wholesale marketplace built for verified Cambodian retailers and suppliers. The Platform connects independent retail merchants with trusted wholesalers through a secure escrow payment system, featuring sample verification, group co-buying, and automated escrow protections.",
  "termsConditionsSection1Point2": "By creating an account, you confirm that:",
  "termsConditionsSection1Point3": "You are at least 18 years of age.",
  "termsConditionsSection1Point4": "You are operating a legitimate business in Cambodia.",
  "termsConditionsSection1Point5": "All information provided during registration is accurate, current, and complete.",
  "termsConditionsSection1Point6": "You agree to comply with these Terms and all applicable local laws and regulations.",

  "termsConditionsSection2Title": "2. Account Registration & Verification",
  "termsConditionsSection2Point1": "All users must register with valid business and identity information before completing any transaction on the Platform.",
  "termsConditionsSection2Point2": "Bosdom reserves the right to reject or suspend account registrations that fail identity verification or contain false information.",
  "termsConditionsSection2Point3": "Each user is limited to one verified merchant profile per business.",
  "termsConditionsSection2Point4": "Suppliers are required to provide accurate product listings, pricing, and inventory information at all times.",
  "termsConditionsSection2Point5": "Buyers are responsible for keeping their account and business information up to date.",

  "termsConditionsSection3Title": "3. Try-Before-You-Bulk Sample Gate",
  "termsConditionsSection3Point1": "Bosdom's Sample Gate lets buyers order a single unit of a product at consumer price before committing to a bulk wholesale purchase.",
  "termsConditionsSection3Point2": "Each buyer is limited to one sample order per product to prevent misuse of the feature.",
  "termsConditionsSection3Point3": "Sample orders do not carry wholesale pricing and are subject to standard shipping and handling fees.",
  "termsConditionsSection3Point4": "Suppliers must fulfill sample orders with the same product quality advertised in the listing. Misrepresenting sample quality is a violation of these Terms.",

  "termsConditionsSection4Title": "4. Collaborative Social Co-Buying",
  "termsConditionsSection4Point1": "Bosdom's Co-Buy feature lets buyers combine orders with other merchants to unlock wholesale bulk pricing.",
  "termsConditionsSection4Point2": "Any registered buyer may start a co-buy pool by selecting \"Invite to Co-Buy\" on an eligible product and sharing the generated invite link.",
  "termsConditionsSection4Point3": "Once a pool reaches its target quantity, the supplier fulfills the order under the applicable bulk pricing tier.",
  "termsConditionsSection4Point4": "Participants share shipping costs proportionally to their share of the order.",
  "termsConditionsSection4Point5": "If a co-buy pool does not reach its required threshold within the specified timeframe, all funds are automatically refunded to participants.",

  "termsConditionsSection5Title": "5. Escrow Payment & QR Verification System",
  "termsConditionsSection5Point1": "All financial transactions on Bosdom are processed through the Platform's escrow system.",
  "termsConditionsSection5Point2": "Supported payment methods include Bakong (National Bank of Cambodia) and other approved payment gateways.",
  "termsConditionsSection5Point3": "Funds are held in escrow until delivery is confirmed.",
  "termsConditionsSection5Point4": "Upon delivery, the receiving party must scan the QR code presented by the supplier or courier to confirm receipt.",
  "termsConditionsSection5Point5": "Once delivery is confirmed via QR scan, escrow funds are released to the supplier. Delivery issues may be escalated through the dispute resolution process described in Section 8.",

  "termsConditionsSection6Title": "6. Chat Policy & Communication Rules",
  "termsConditionsSection6Point1": "Bosdom provides in-app chat for direct communication between buyers and suppliers.",
  "termsConditionsSection6Point2": "Before accessing chat, users must review and accept the Chat & Trading Policy and Liability Disclosure.",
  "termsConditionsSection6Point3": "The following are prohibited in Platform communications:",
  "termsConditionsSection6Point4": "Arranging payments outside the Platform.",
  "termsConditionsSection6Point5": "Sharing personal bank details for off-platform payment.",
  "termsConditionsSection6Point6": "Sending abusive, fraudulent, or otherwise inappropriate content.",
  "termsConditionsSection6Point7": "Bosdom holds no liability for losses arising from off-platform payments or trades arranged in violation of this policy. Violations may result in a warning, account suspension, or permanent ban, depending on severity, at Bosdom's sole discretion.",

  "termsConditionsSection7Title": "7. Pricing & Volume Tiers",
  "termsConditionsSection7Point1": "Suppliers set their own pricing for both sample and bulk purchase tiers.",
  "termsConditionsSection7Point2": "Bulk pricing is structured in volume tiers that unlock as a co-buy pool or bulk order grows.",
  "termsConditionsSection7Point3": "Applicable pricing tiers are shown on each product listing and update automatically as order volume changes.",
  "termsConditionsSection7Point4": "Bosdom does not own, store, or handle physical inventory. Suppliers are solely responsible for product quality, packaging, and inventory accuracy. Prices may be listed in Khmer Riel (KHR) or US Dollars (USD).",

  "termsConditionsSection8Title": "8. Dispute Resolution",
  "termsConditionsSection8Point1": "In the event of a dispute, such as damaged goods, non-delivery, or a quality mismatch, Bosdom provides a structured dispute resolution process.",
  "termsConditionsSection8Point2": "Escrow funds related to a disputed order remain locked until the dispute is resolved.",
  "termsConditionsSection8Point3": "Buyers have a 5-day window after delivery confirmation to file a dispute and submit supporting evidence.",
  "termsConditionsSection8Point4": "Bosdom reserves the right to review evidence and adjust escrow disbursement in cases of fraud, non-delivery, or breach of these Terms.",

  "termsConditionsSection9Title": "9. Prohibited Activities",
  "termsConditionsSection9Point1": "Users of the Platform must not:",
  "termsConditionsSection9Point2": "Sell counterfeit, illegal, or hazardous goods.",
  "termsConditionsSection9Point3": "Create multiple accounts to bypass sample-gate limits.",
  "termsConditionsSection9Point4": "Manipulate co-buy pools through fake participants or false pricing.",
  "termsConditionsSection9Point5": "Engage in price fixing, deceptive advertising, or false product listings.",
  "termsConditionsSection9Point6": "Use automated bots or scripts to interact with the Platform.",
  "termsConditionsSection9Point7": "Violating any of the above may result in immediate account suspension, forfeiture of pending escrow funds, and, where applicable, referral to relevant authorities.",

  "termsConditionsSection10Title": "10. Limitation of Liability",
  "termsConditionsSection10Point1": "Bosdom acts solely as a marketplace facilitator connecting buyers and suppliers. To the maximum extent permitted by law, Bosdom is not liable for:",
  "termsConditionsSection10Point2": "Product quality, accuracy of descriptions, or supplier claims.",
  "termsConditionsSection10Point3": "Delivery timelines or courier performance beyond the Platform's control.",
  "termsConditionsSection10Point4": "Losses resulting from a user's violation of these Terms or applicable Cambodian law.",
  "termsConditionsSection10Point5": "Bosdom is not liable for indirect, incidental, or consequential damages arising from use of the Platform.",

  "termsConditionsSection11Title": "11. Privacy & Data Protection",
  "termsConditionsSection11Point1": "Bosdom collects and processes personal data in accordance with our Privacy Policy and applicable Cambodian data protection laws.",
  "termsConditionsSection11Point2": "This includes business registration details, name, phone number, and email address, collected solely for identity verification and Platform operation.",

  "termsConditionsSection12Title": "12. Modifications to Terms",
  "termsConditionsSection12Point1": "Bosdom reserves the right to update or modify these Terms at any time. Continued use of the Platform after changes take effect constitutes acceptance of the updated Terms.",
  "termsConditionsSection12Point2": "Users who do not agree with updated Terms should discontinue use of the Platform.",

  "termsConditionsContactTitle": "Contact Us",
  "termsConditionsContactIntro": "If you have questions about these Terms & Conditions, please contact us:",
  "termsConditionsContactEmail": "support@bosdom.com",
  "termsConditionsContactInApp": "In-app: Help & Support",

  "privacyPolicyScreenTitle": "Privacy Policy",
  "privacyPolicyEffectiveDate": "Effective Date: August 2026",

  "privacyPolicySection1Title": "1. Information We Collect",
  "privacyPolicySection1Point1": "a) Account Information",
  "privacyPolicySection1Point2": "Full name, phone number, and email",
  "privacyPolicySection1Point3": "Business name, type, and registration number",
  "privacyPolicySection1Point4": "Business location and delivery address",
  "privacyPolicySection1Point5": "Profile photo (optional)",
  "privacyPolicySection1Point6": "b) Identity Verification Info",
  "privacyPolicySection1Point7": "Government-issued ID (for buyer verification)",
  "privacyPolicySection1Point8": "Business registration certificate (for supplier verification)",
  "privacyPolicySection1Point9": "Bank account/e-wallet details (Bakong QR) for payments",
  "privacyPolicySection1Point10": "c) Transaction Data",
  "privacyPolicySection1Point11": "Order history, purchase amounts, and payment methods",
  "privacyPolicySection1Point12": "Sample order and co-buy pool participation",
  "privacyPolicySection1Point13": "d) Communication Data",
  "privacyPolicySection1Point14": "In-app chat messages and conversation history",
  "privacyPolicySection1Point15": "Chat attachments shared between participants",
  "privacyPolicySection1Point16": "e) Verification & Fraud Detection",
  "privacyPolicySection1Point17": "QR code scans used for delivery confirmation",
  "privacyPolicySection1Point18": "Video evidence submitted with dispute resolution",
  "privacyPolicySection1Point19": "f) Device & Usage Data",
  "privacyPolicySection1Point20": "Device type, operating system, and app version",
  "privacyPolicySection1Point21": "Location data used for delivery and courier matching",
  "privacyPolicySection1Point22": "IP address and general session/log information",
  "privacyPolicySection1Point23": "g) Co-Buy & Social Data",
  "privacyPolicySection1Point24": "Co-buy invitation creation and participation",
  "privacyPolicySection1Point25": "Invite link clicks and pool-joining activity",

  "privacyPolicySection2Title": "2. How We Use Your Information",
  "privacyPolicySection2Point1": "We use your personal data for the following purposes:",
  "privacyPolicySection2Point2": "a) Platform Operations",
  "privacyPolicySection2Point3": "To create and manage your buyer or seller account",
  "privacyPolicySection2Point4": "To process orders, payments, and shipment tracking",
  "privacyPolicySection2Point5": "To facilitate the Try-Before-You-Bulk sample gate feature",
  "privacyPolicySection2Point6": "To enable Co-Buy session creation and order pooling",
  "privacyPolicySection2Point7": "b) Trust & Safety",
  "privacyPolicySection2Point8": "To verify identity for suppliers and buyers",
  "privacyPolicySection2Point9": "To confirm order delivery via QR code scan",
  "privacyPolicySection2Point10": "To detect and prevent off-platform payment or contact violations",
  "privacyPolicySection2Point11": "To process disputes, evidence submissions, and refund requests",
  "privacyPolicySection2Point12": "c) Payment Processing & Analytics",
  "privacyPolicySection2Point13": "To securely process payments through Bakong and other integrated payment providers",
  "privacyPolicySection2Point14": "To hold funds in escrow until delivery is confirmed",
  "privacyPolicySection2Point15": "To analyze usage patterns and improve app features and performance",
  "privacyPolicySection2Point16": "To personalize product recommendations and search suggestions",
  "privacyPolicySection2Point17": "d) Push Notifications",
  "privacyPolicySection2Point18": "To notify you about order status updates, chat messages, co-buy progress, and important account activity",
  "privacyPolicySection2Point19": "e) Legal Compliance",
  "privacyPolicySection2Point20": "To comply with applicable legal requirements",
  "privacyPolicySection2Point21": "To respond to lawful requests from authorities",
  "privacyPolicySection2Point22": "f) Business Transfers",
  "privacyPolicySection2Point23": "In the event of a merger, acquisition, or asset sale, information may be transferred as part of the business assets, subject to equivalent privacy protection",

  "privacyPolicySection3Title": "3. How We Share Your Information",
  "privacyPolicySection3Point1": "We do not sell your personal data. We only share information in the following circumstances:",
  "privacyPolicySection3Point2": "a) Between Buyers & Sellers",
  "privacyPolicySection3Point3": "Business name, rating, and product listings shared to enable trading",
  "privacyPolicySection3Point4": "Chat messages shared strictly between chat participants",
  "privacyPolicySection3Point5": "b) Payment Providers",
  "privacyPolicySection3Point6": "Transaction data shared with Bakong and other approved gateways to complete payments",
  "privacyPolicySection3Point7": "c) Service Providers",
  "privacyPolicySection3Point8": "Cloud hosting and data storage (Supabase infrastructure)",
  "privacyPolicySection3Point9": "Analytics services to improve app performance and user experience",
  "privacyPolicySection3Point10": "d) Legal Requirements",
  "privacyPolicySection3Point11": "When required by applicable legal requirements",
  "privacyPolicySection3Point12": "To protect Bosdom's legal rights or investigate fraud",
  "privacyPolicySection3Point13": "e) Business Transfers",
  "privacyPolicySection3Point14": "In the event of a merger, acquisition, or reorganization of Bosdom, user data may be transferred with equivalent privacy protection commitments",

  "privacyPolicySection4Title": "4. Data Storage & Security",
  "privacyPolicySection4Point1": "Your data is stored securely using Supabase infrastructure, which provides:",
  "privacyPolicySection4Point2": "Encryption of data in transit (TLS/SSL) and at rest",
  "privacyPolicySection4Point3": "Secure authentication and session management",
  "privacyPolicySection4Point4": "Access controls and regular security audits with vulnerability assessments",
  "privacyPolicySection4Point5": "Escrow payment information is protected using PCI-compliant payment gateway standards.",
  "privacyPolicySection4Point6": "Chat conversations and dispute evidence are encrypted and access-restricted to relevant parties.",
  "privacyPolicySection4Point7": "While we implement industry-standard security measures, no method of electronic transmission or storage is 100% secure.",

  "privacyPolicySection5Title": "5. Data Retention",
  "privacyPolicySection5Point1": "We retain your personal data only for as long as necessary to fulfill the purposes outlined in this policy:",
  "privacyPolicySection5Point2": "Account Data — retained while your account is active and for up to 12 months after deletion",
  "privacyPolicySection5Point3": "Transaction Records — retained for 5 years for accounting and legal compliance",
  "privacyPolicySection5Point4": "Chat Messages — retained for 12 months",
  "privacyPolicySection5Point5": "Dispute Evidence — retained for 12 months after resolution",
  "privacyPolicySection5Point6": "You may request account deletion at any time by contacting support or using the in-app support feature.",

  "privacyPolicySection6Title": "6. Your Privacy Rights",
  "privacyPolicySection6Point1": "As a Bosdom user, you have the right to:",
  "privacyPolicySection6Point2": "Access — request a copy of the personal data we hold about you",
  "privacyPolicySection6Point3": "Correction — update inaccurate or outdated information",
  "privacyPolicySection6Point4": "Deletion — request deletion of your personal data, subject to legal retention requirements",
  "privacyPolicySection6Point5": "Data Portability — request your data in a machine-readable format",
  "privacyPolicySection6Point6": "Notification Preferences — manage notification settings within the app",
  "privacyPolicySection6Point7": "Opt-Out — opt out of marketing communications at any time",
  "privacyPolicySection6Point8": "To exercise these rights, contact us at privacy@bosdom.com or via the in-app Support section.",

  "privacyPolicySection7Title": "7. Chat & Communication Privacy",
  "privacyPolicySection7Point1": "All in-app chat messages are stored securely and only accessible to conversation participants.",
  "privacyPolicySection7Point2": "Bosdom automatically monitors chat content for off-platform contact detection and scam prevention purposes only.",
  "privacyPolicySection7Point3": "Flagged messages may be reviewed manually by our Trust & Safety team.",
  "privacyPolicySection7Point4": "Soliciting direct contact information through chat may result in account restrictions or bans as outlined in our Terms & Conditions.",

  "privacyPolicySection8Title": "8. Children's Privacy",
  "privacyPolicySection8Point1": "Bosdom is a B2B wholesale marketplace intended for use by verified business users aged 18 and above. We do not knowingly collect data from minors.",

  "privacyPolicySection9Title": "9. Changes to This Policy",
  "privacyPolicySection9Point1": "We may update this Privacy Policy periodically to reflect changes in our practices, legal requirements, or platform features. Material changes will be communicated via:",
  "privacyPolicySection9Point2": "A prominent notice within the app",
  "privacyPolicySection9Point3": "Email notification to registered users",
  "privacyPolicySection9Point4": "An updated \"Last Modified\" date",

